GIMP Palette
Name: Wingpunk40
Columns: 8
# Locked palette for Bullethell Gamejam. Derived from the histogram of the
# game's existing pixel art (fried gold, sauce red and warm browns dominated),
# then curated into ten ramps.
#
# Hue roles are load-bearing, not decorative:
#   COOL   = player-owned (bullets, energy, dash) -- reads instantly vs warm
#   SAUCE  = enemy-owned (bullets, damage, telegraphs)
#   GOLD   = the wing/batter identity; pickups, coins, hero surfaces.
#            GOLD_3 is #F7912C exactly -- the player's hoodie orange, the
#            single most common colour in the game. Do not drift it.
#   VIOLET = boss / cursed / rare tier
#   STEEL  = stainless kitchen equipment (fryers, counters, cleavers, armour)
#   SKIN   = character faces and hands
# Do not add colours. Recolour by remapping within a ramp.
#
  15  10  12	INK_0 outline
  36  26  29	INK_1
  62  49  54	INK_2
  95  82  89	INK_3
